      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Reference to component in prefab asset is useful for some case so removing prefab asset on build can cause behavior.\n\nSo I think it's good to make warning and auto fix button onto control panel.\n\n(e.g. we can make world fixed object in avatar with constraint to prefab asset)",
